UnitSwapHookLib::AfterSwap
├── when swapHook is address zero
│   └── it skips writing to gaugeFees
└── when swapHook isn't address zero
    ├── when call fails
    │   └── it skips writing to gaugeFees
    ├── when call succeeds but fee is gt fee ceil
    │   └── it writes to gaugeFees using _SWAP_FEE_CEIL
    └── when call succeeds and fee is leq fee ceil
        ├── when amountSpecified is gt zero
        │   ├── when swap is zeroForOne and exactInput
        │   │   ├── it decreases SwapState.amountCalculated by fee amount
        │   │   └── it increases gaugeFees.token1 by fee amount
        │   └── when swap is oneForZero and exactInput
        │       ├── it decreases SwapState.amountCalculated by fee amount
        │       └── it increases gaugeFees.token0 by fee amount
        └── when amountSpecified is lt zero
            ├── when swap is zeroForOne and exactOutput
            │   ├── it increases SwapState.amountCalculated by fee amount
            │   └── it increases gaugeFees.token0 by fee amount
            └── when swap is oneForZero and exactOutput
                ├── it increases SwapState.amountCalculated by fee amount
                └── it increases gaugeFees.token1 by fee amount
